l other requests and mandatory auth.bind, query-token rejection and default TLS checks. ADR-0010 was independently accepted before implementation; the product repair separately passed independent review and scoped CI.\n\nValidation:\n- Full independent implementation review and clean local Acceptance of merged candidate744d943 PASS: actual responsibilities/imports, contracts, minimality, architecture/frozen/53 controls, Desktop compile/auth/composer and uncached Gateway admission/auth tests. The disabled live-DB test is disclosed.\n- Windows Architect approves43 original captures; real native notifications/tray/shortcut, appearance retention, auth expiry/logout credential cleanup, controlled SEND/retry/reconnect and SQLite/PostgreSQL identity/convergence receipts are bound to the unchanged installed source/package.\n- Android API34 and prior independent presentation/auth/TLS reviews remain precisely bound: five new auth captures plus98 unaffected references; actual expiry/refresh/logout/isolation and complete original CA rollback are documented.\n- Same-desktop Windows temporary CA rollback, fresh default-TLS rejection with live request-scoped positive, other-root preservation, restored preferences and owned process/container/volume cleanup PASS. Helper/config remains restored; only occupation-blocked helper regression is deferred to S2 Gate.\n\nEvidence: `spec/progress/evidence/LOOP1-CLIENT-GUI-001/win20261008/`, `integration20261008/`, `final-review20261008/`; latest checkpoint `spec/progress/checkpoints/2026-10-08-loop1-client-gui-001-windows-reviewed.md`.\n\nTask review / S2 OPEN. Exact full-range CI, protected integration, actual-main verification and safe synchronization remain required. Old or incremental CI does not establish acceptance for this final head. Original failed attempts and the withdrawn nonstandard closed-WebSocket host negative are retained with their limitations.\r\n\nOriginal full PR CI [37733952699](https://github.com/nilesthump/IM-platform/actions/runs/37733952699) at6f21e00 remains FAIL:12 instances passed, Mobile and gate failed. The failure was reproduced: actual Register pixels and a fresh accessibility tree show Confirm password, while the cached tree still showed Login. Candidate d376264 repairs only anonymous instrumentation root reads with the existing SDK clearCache pattern; product bytes, assertions, timing and PASS conditions are unchanged. Same capture46 and three exact no-capture46 pass locally; originals and identical application APK bindings are preserved in mobile-ci-fix20261008/. Fresh independent exact-candidate Review and a new full CI determine acceptance. Integration and main synchronization remain pending.","created_at":"2026-10-07T13:57:56Z","updated_at":"2026-10-08T06:34:19Z","closed_at":"2026-10-08T06:34:19Z","merged_at":"2026-10-08T06:34:19Z","merge_commit_sha":"b14bf1070ba26ac368488e2c6ea15a7936e2de89","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilesthump/IM-platform/pulls/24/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilesthump/IM-platform/pulls/24/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilesthump/IM-platform/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilesthump/IM-platform/issues/24/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilesthump/IM-platform/statuses/d37626427b96fc7040280a0fe5a5cda8a700cb16","head":{"label":"nilesthump:task/LOOP1-CLIENT-GUI-001-resume","ref":"task/LOOP1-CLIENT-GUI-001-resume","sha":"d37626427b96fc7040280a0fe5a5cda8a700cb16","user":{"login":"nilesthump","id":211787881,"node_id":"U_kgDODJ-gaQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211787881?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nilesthump","html_url":"https://github.com/nilesthump","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nilesthump/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.co